            {
              "id": "1773434637366_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given a JSON object. Summarize it in a HTML table with column headers on the first row and values on the second row. Result is Only use the array under the key \"items\".\nUser Current DateTime: {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}\n\nColumns (in this exact order) and mapping: \n1. Shipment: shipmentPk\n2. Total Actual Cost: totalActualCost.value + totalActualCost.currency with value rounded to 2 decimals (example: 999.99 USD).\n3. Total Weighted Cost: totalWeightedCost.value + totalWeightedCost.currency with value rounded to 2 decimals.\n4. Start Time: convert startTime.value from ISO 8601 into format \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\", adjusting from UTC (\"Z\") to match the timezone of the User Current DateTime.\n5. End Time: convert endTime.value using the same format and timezone rules as Start Time.\n6. Service Provider: serviceProviderID\n7. Transport Mode: transportMode\n8. Rate Offering: rateOffering\n9. Equipment Group: equipmentGroup\n\nOutput only the HTML table (no extra text).\n\nJSON object: {{$context.$nodes.CHANGE_SERVICE_PROVIDER.$output}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
