              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given a JSON object containing service provider options under items[]. Convert items[] into a HTML table with one row per item.\n\nColumns (in this exact order) and mapping:\n1. Status: tenderStatus\n2. Service Provider: serviceProviderId\n3. Equipment Group: equipmentGroupGid\n4. Mode: transportModeGid\n5. Rate Offering: rateOfferingGid\n6. Rate Record: rateGeoGid\n7. Cost: totalCost.value + totalCost.currency with value rounded to 2 decimals (example: 99.99 USD)\n8. Weighted Cost: totalWeightedCost.value + totalWeightedCost.currency with value rounded to 2 decimals\n\nOutput only the HTML table (no extra text).\n\nJSON object:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_SERV_PROV_OPTIONS.$output}}"
