              "value": "Extract shipment identifier(s) from the user feedback: {{$context.$nodes.ASK_SHIPMENT.$feedbackRecieved}}\n\nExtraction rules (in priority order):\n1. Explicit shipment mention (highest confidence):\n- If the message contains labels like shipment, shipment gid, shipment xid, ship gid, ship id, sh gid, sh id, extract the identifier(s) immediately following (or clearly associated with) that label.\n- Support multiple identifiers if present (comma/space/newline/“and” separated).\n2. Use the whole value as a shipment id\n\nNormalization:\n- Uppercase every extracted shipment identifier and put in an string array.\n- If not found, return empty array.\n\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact schema:\n{\n  \"shipment\": [\"<SHIPMENT_1>\", \"<SHIPMENT_2>\"]\n}"
