                      "value": "Find the maximum numeric value of iTransactionNo from all objects in items in the provided JSON object input. \nTreat iTransactionNo as a number.\nIf items is missing or empty, return NotFound.\n\nReturn only this JSON output (no extra text):\n{ \n\"collabId\": \"<MAX_iTransactionNo or NotFound>\" \n}\n\nJSON object input: {{$context.$nodes.FOR_VALID_SHIPMENT.GET_TENDERS_FOR_EACH_SHIPMENT.$output}}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"collabId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "CollabId Found"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "true": "1775163255016",
                    "false": "1775163280355"
                  },
                  "code": "COLLABID_FOUND",
